# Missing transitive dependencies (added 2026-08-20).
#
# These three were absent from the published index, and the first two are the
# root of every "unable to select packages" failure seen against this repo:
#
#   libtirpc-dev  required by libnsl-dev, which libc6-dev pulls in. Its absence
#                 makes zlib1g-dev and libtool uninstallable, which is what
#                 breaks the SDK compat tests (0/7) and the pigz/apk-tools
#                 stages of the self-hosted image build.
#   libpkgconf3   required by pkgconf-bin, which pkg-config depends on. Its
#                 absence makes pkg-config uninstallable outright.
#
# Both of the above are already published as *dependents* (zlib1g-dev, libtool,
# pkg-config, pkgconf-bin and libnsl-dev are all in the index) -- only these
# roots were missed, so publishing them repairs the whole chain.
#
#   libarchive-dev  not in any seed's closure, so it was never scheduled at
#                   all; needed to build pixz.
libtirpc-dev
libpkgconf3
libarchive-dev
